      "content": "that's heavy, i love the 'festering wound' line. really sets the tone.\n\nto make it feel more grounded, i want to zoom in on the people who make the street feel that way. could you describe a few of the individuals hanging out on the corners? i'm looking for more specific details about their physical appearance—like their skin tones, their clothes, or any specific ethnic or cultural markers that would ground this in a real urban environment. i want the reader to be able to look at them and immediately understand the demographic vibe of the neighborhood.",
